WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 22=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:51.760 --> 01:54.800
As expected of someone raised
by Dowager Consort Zheng.

01:54.856 --> 01:56.072
(Zheng Manyi)
Manyi's manners

01:56.080 --> 01:57.270
(Duke Xianguo's Youngest Daughter)
and bearing...

01:57.760 --> 01:59.119
She outshines all the young ladies

01:59.120 --> 02:00.800
in our Lin family.

02:01.432 --> 02:04.140
(Wei Tianxuan, Zheng Manyi's Mother)
I find Xiuru quiet and refined,

02:04.152 --> 02:05.310
and Xiushu sweet and innocent.

02:05.310 --> 02:06.984
(Duchess Xianguo)
I like them even better.

02:07.519 --> 02:08.718
While I was in the capital,

02:08.719 --> 02:10.519
I often heard Dowager Consort Zheng

02:10.520 --> 02:12.359
speak fondly of the young ladies here.

02:12.919 --> 02:14.999
I specially picked out
some gifts to bring back

02:15.000 --> 02:16.799
as a small gesture of affection.

02:20.800 --> 02:23.759
I heard you often copy
Buddhist scriptures for Old Madam.

02:24.080 --> 02:27.840
These days, the Pan family's Huizhou ink
is considered the finest.

02:27.919 --> 02:30.318
They only made
three inksticks of this kind.

02:30.319 --> 02:31.638
Xiuru, give it a try

02:31.639 --> 02:33.079
and see how it compares

02:33.080 --> 02:34.639
with Li ink.

02:34.919 --> 02:36.359
Thank you, Manyi.

02:41.719 --> 02:44.359
I heard you're prone
to pollen rashes, Xiushu.

02:46.639 --> 02:48.120
These are Qingyang Pills.

02:48.639 --> 02:49.718
Imperial Physician Wang,

02:49.719 --> 02:52.598
who tends to Dowager Consort Zheng,
is skilled at treating rashes.

02:52.599 --> 02:54.638
I asked him to make these for you.

02:54.639 --> 02:56.198
If you start taking care of it now,

02:56.199 --> 02:59.359
perhaps by next spring, you won't have
to fear peach blossoms anymore.

03:00.280 --> 03:01.720
Thank you, Manyi.

03:04.919 --> 03:06.160
Manyi,

03:06.680 --> 03:07.799
come here.

03:11.840 --> 03:14.039
The more I see of you,
the more I like you.

03:14.120 --> 03:17.440
I only wish you were one
of our Lin family's daughters.

03:18.639 --> 03:20.559
My husband feels the same way about you.

03:20.560 --> 03:22.878
He praises Jinqi every day

03:22.879 --> 03:25.479
and wishes Jinqi were his own son.

03:26.808 --> 03:28.190
- Young Master.
- Young Master.

03:41.039 --> 03:42.639
Greetings, Duchess Xianguo.

03:43.159 --> 03:44.120
Mother.

03:45.159 --> 03:48.400
He truly is handsome and distinguished.

03:51.080 --> 03:53.959
No wonder he's repeatedly
distinguished himself in the army

03:53.960 --> 03:56.320
and earned endless praise
from my husband.

03:58.280 --> 03:59.999
This is the Duke's youngest daughter.

04:00.000 --> 04:01.758
She just returned from the capital.

04:01.759 --> 04:04.079
You should address her
as your younger sister.

04:09.240 --> 04:10.359
Manyi.

04:12.479 --> 04:13.680
Jinqi.

04:14.599 --> 04:16.999
Old Madam has been talking
constantly these past few days

04:17.000 --> 04:19.320
about Dowager Consort Zheng and Manyi.

04:19.839 --> 04:21.159
Why don't we have Manyi

04:21.160 --> 04:23.360
go pay her respects to Old Madam?

04:25.759 --> 04:27.599
I was thinking the same thing.

04:27.600 --> 04:30.799
Dowager Consort Zheng
also misses Old Madam very much.

04:30.800 --> 04:31.679
Jinqi,

04:31.680 --> 04:32.999
we have things to discuss.

04:33.000 --> 04:33.958
Take Manyi

04:33.959 --> 04:35.679
to spend some time with Old Madam

04:35.680 --> 04:37.360
and keep her company.

04:40.959 --> 04:41.800
Yes.

04:43.839 --> 04:44.920
I'll take my leave.

04:46.120 --> 04:47.159
Manyi,

04:47.279 --> 04:48.199
please.

04:56.680 --> 04:58.159
Thank you, Jinqi.

05:37.199 --> 05:38.800
Resounding Call Pavilion.

05:42.639 --> 05:45.000
I suppose the name comes
from Liu Mengde's lines,

05:45.176 --> 05:47.150
"From this moment,
his resounding call begins,

05:47.160 --> 05:49.000
as he gazes toward the lofty clouds."

05:50.480 --> 05:52.279
Everyone loves those lines,

05:52.560 --> 05:53.599
but I prefer

05:53.600 --> 05:55.759
another line from that poem.

05:56.279 --> 05:58.360
"All around me, the world falls still.

05:58.480 --> 06:00.360
With a cup of liquor,
the heart grows free."

06:01.759 --> 06:03.159
Carefree and unrestrained,

06:03.160 --> 06:04.519
with a spirit all its own.

06:08.070 --> 06:10.600
Liu Mengde's poem may
be polished and elegant,

06:10.712 --> 06:13.190
but it was ultimately written
in response to another poem,

06:13.190 --> 06:14.776
which makes it somewhat less inspired.

06:15.639 --> 06:16.758
By comparison,

06:16.760 --> 06:18.424
I prefer one written by his good friend,

06:18.472 --> 06:21.199
Zhang Shuibu, a well-known yuefu verse.

06:25.639 --> 06:26.759
Young Master.

06:36.279 --> 06:37.959
What's got you in such a rush?

06:39.630 --> 06:41.944
Yu... Yuchan said the leaves

06:41.976 --> 06:43.304
on this orchid are turning yellow.

06:43.336 --> 06:44.470
Something doesn't look right.

06:44.480 --> 06:46.479
She asked me to get
your opinion, Young Master.

06:46.480 --> 06:47.278
Should we take it

06:47.280 --> 06:49.288
to a gardener who knows
how to care for orchids?

06:49.439 --> 06:50.479
Why are you even asking me?

06:50.480 --> 06:51.719
Hurry and take it there.

06:53.279 --> 06:55.878
Yuchan was worried you'd come back

06:55.879 --> 06:57.159
and suddenly find it gone

06:57.160 --> 06:58.480
and be upset.

07:00.040 --> 07:01.480
I'll take it over right away.

07:10.240 --> 07:11.920
I'm sorry you had to see that, Manyi.

07:21.040 --> 07:22.880
That orchid

07:23.279 --> 07:26.159
must mean a great deal to you.

07:33.439 --> 07:36.359
I just remembered
I have official business to attend to.

07:36.360 --> 07:37.638
I have to go take care of it.

07:37.639 --> 07:39.120
I'm afraid I can't stay with you.

07:39.839 --> 07:41.278
I hope you'll forgive me, Manyi.

07:41.279 --> 07:43.360
I'll make it up to you another day.

07:45.439 --> 07:46.800
Official business comes first.

07:46.959 --> 07:48.599
Go ahead, Jinqi.

07:48.959 --> 07:50.039
Old Madam's residence

07:50.040 --> 07:51.560
is just a few steps ahead.

07:51.680 --> 07:53.519
Yinchen, lead the way.

07:55.199 --> 07:56.320
Yes.

08:19.100 --> 08:22.159
(Duke Xianguo's Residence)

08:22.160 --> 08:23.920
"Song of a Faithful Wife"?

08:25.480 --> 08:28.599
I return your precious pearl
with tears in my eyes,

08:28.800 --> 08:31.680
regretting we did not meet before I wed.

08:32.960 --> 08:35.599
What exactly
is Lin Jinqi trying to tell us?

08:36.960 --> 08:40.119
Is he planning
to remain faithful to Zhao Xingtang?

08:42.000 --> 08:43.119
Manyi,

08:44.879 --> 08:46.920
tell me exactly

08:47.679 --> 08:50.599
what Lin Jinqi meant.

08:51.600 --> 08:53.160
Zhang Ji's poem

08:53.672 --> 08:55.288
appears to be about a faithful wife,

08:55.624 --> 08:58.040
but he was actually using it
to express his own position,

08:58.279 --> 09:00.678
politely rejecting the overtures

09:00.679 --> 09:02.879
of Li Shidao,
the Military Governor of Pinglu.

09:04.279 --> 09:07.398
Lin Jinqi realized
you wanted to win him over.

09:07.399 --> 09:09.160
He was politely turning you down.

09:09.759 --> 09:12.160
No wonder Grand Secretary Zhao
thinks so highly of him.

09:13.799 --> 09:15.800
He really is shrewd and formidable.

09:16.039 --> 09:17.560
Then should we

09:17.840 --> 09:19.038
still pursue this marriage?

09:19.039 --> 09:20.040
Yes.

09:20.840 --> 09:21.999
We must.

09:22.759 --> 09:24.798
The Crown Prince values him now.

09:24.799 --> 09:27.680
Our family needs him as a son-in-law.

09:28.480 --> 09:31.119
But Lin Jinqi
has already turned us down.

09:31.519 --> 09:32.398
Well...

09:32.399 --> 09:34.320
Marriage has always been

09:34.679 --> 09:36.800
a matter decided
by parents and matchmakers.

09:36.840 --> 09:39.160
It's not for Lin Jinqi to decide.

09:40.679 --> 09:41.800
Besides,

09:42.879 --> 09:44.800
with Manyi's beauty and talent,

09:45.000 --> 09:47.599
and the standing of our ducal family,

09:48.840 --> 09:50.959
Lin Jinqi is only human.

09:51.480 --> 09:53.760
Once you know what appeals to him,

09:54.480 --> 09:55.959
cater to his interests,

09:55.960 --> 09:57.479
and speak of what pleases him,

09:58.240 --> 10:00.119
you can make him want you

10:00.679 --> 10:02.119
so much that he can't refuse.

10:16.039 --> 10:17.999
This is
the deposed Emperor's eldest son,

10:18.159 --> 10:19.359
Crown Prince Jian.

10:23.639 --> 10:25.160
You asked me here late at night.

10:25.279 --> 10:26.758
Surely it wasn't to discuss

10:26.759 --> 10:28.320
the imperial family's looks.

10:29.840 --> 10:31.479
When His Majesty seized the city,

10:31.480 --> 10:32.879
a fire broke out in the palace.

10:33.200 --> 10:35.599
The deposed Emperor and Crown Prince
disappeared after that.

10:35.600 --> 10:38.280
It's said they fled overseas.

10:38.312 --> 10:40.200
His Majesty could never
put the matter to rest,

10:40.240 --> 10:43.599
so he sent Defense Commander Zheng
overseas several times to search for them.

10:45.799 --> 10:47.798
Those are nothing
but unsubstantiated rumors.

10:47.799 --> 10:48.999
They can't be taken seriously.

10:49.240 --> 10:50.920
There's another rumor
going around lately.

10:50.952 --> 10:52.190
It says the deposed Crown Prince

10:52.200 --> 10:54.239
never left with the deposed Emperor

10:54.240 --> 10:56.599
and is still in Jinling.

11:00.568 --> 11:03.680
The bloodshed in Jinling all those years
ago is still fresh in people's minds.

11:03.752 --> 11:05.990
Who is trying to use this rumor
to destroy someone now?

11:08.279 --> 11:09.800
Whether it's true or not,

11:10.600 --> 11:13.199
the Crown Prince has received
secret orders from His Majesty

11:13.200 --> 11:14.999
to investigate the matter.

11:15.336 --> 11:17.350
I hear Prince Han
has also sent a trusted aide,

11:17.360 --> 11:19.479
hoping to get ahead of the Crown Prince

11:19.480 --> 11:21.479
and resolve
His Majesty's concerns first.

11:22.200 --> 11:23.320
Fengtai,

11:24.080 --> 11:26.999
you and I must both
proceed with caution.

11:30.879 --> 11:32.599
More than twenty years have passed.

11:33.840 --> 11:36.696
I'm afraid looks alone
won't be enough to find him.

11:36.872 --> 11:38.190
Before my father passed away,

11:38.200 --> 11:40.890
he taught the deposed Crown Prince
riding and archery for a few days.

11:40.960 --> 11:42.296
The index finger on his left hand

11:42.300 --> 11:44.390
was half a joint longer
than his middle finger,

11:44.399 --> 11:45.760
which was unusual.

11:46.039 --> 11:47.599
He was self-conscious about it

11:47.799 --> 11:50.160
and often kept his left hand
curled inside his sleeve.

11:50.240 --> 11:51.800
Few people knew about it.

11:56.360 --> 11:59.160
Those determined to find out always can.

12:12.540 --> 12:14.479
(Lu Family Painting
and Calligraphy Shop)

12:14.480 --> 12:15.479
Young Lady.

12:15.480 --> 12:17.064
Young Master Lin often visits this shop.

12:17.096 --> 12:19.190
There must be something here
that catches his fancy.

12:32.399 --> 12:33.599
Young Lady,

12:33.679 --> 12:35.160
what kind of book are you looking for?

12:36.120 --> 12:37.239
We're just looking around.

12:37.360 --> 12:38.239
All right.

13:01.080 --> 13:02.999
How much is this orchid?

13:04.960 --> 13:05.959
I'm sorry.

13:06.080 --> 13:08.719
This orchid isn't for sale.

13:08.879 --> 13:10.398
If you like orchids,

13:10.399 --> 13:12.479
you can take a look
at our sachets and purses.

13:12.480 --> 13:15.119
Some are embroidered with orchids.

13:18.440 --> 13:21.079
This orchid is very much to my liking.

13:23.360 --> 13:25.560
I'm willing to pay a high price for it.

13:27.200 --> 13:28.439
I'm very sorry.

13:28.440 --> 13:30.999
My daughter raised this orchid.

13:31.240 --> 13:32.400
It's not for sale.

13:37.159 --> 13:39.879
Could you ask your daughter
to come out so we can discuss it?

13:40.000 --> 13:42.320
Perhaps if she sees how sincere I am,

13:43.360 --> 13:44.920
she'll be willing to part with it.

13:45.159 --> 13:46.280
Well...

13:49.279 --> 13:50.400
Then...

13:50.600 --> 13:51.959
Please wait a moment.

13:52.879 --> 13:54.199
Lanxiang!

13:54.519 --> 13:55.680
Lanxiang!

13:55.799 --> 13:57.280
Come here for a moment.

13:57.399 --> 14:00.879
A customer wants to buy
the orchid you've been raising.

14:01.879 --> 14:02.798
Coming.

14:02.799 --> 14:04.440
I'll just wipe my hands and come over.

14:27.840 --> 14:28.999
Young Lady.

14:35.159 --> 14:36.959
As soon as I walked into the shop,

14:37.080 --> 14:39.079
this orchid caught my eye.

14:40.639 --> 14:43.758
This orchid isn't a rare variety.

14:43.759 --> 14:45.800
It grew on its own in our courtyard.

14:45.879 --> 14:48.599
Even the clay pot isn't worth much.

14:49.279 --> 14:50.400
I know.

14:51.200 --> 14:53.680
But money can't always buy
what the heart desires.

14:54.679 --> 14:56.160
I simply like it.

14:56.399 --> 14:58.199
I'm willing to pay a high price for it.

15:04.360 --> 15:06.560
How much are you willing to pay?

15:12.039 --> 15:13.599
Fifty taels of silver.

15:13.679 --> 15:14.760
Fifty?

15:22.679 --> 15:24.760
One hundred taels of silver.

15:33.960 --> 15:36.879
Are you really willing
to pay one hundred taels?

15:39.559 --> 15:41.959
Do you know who my young lady is?

15:42.000 --> 15:43.920
A mere hundred taels of silver...

15:44.440 --> 15:45.278
That's enough.

15:45.279 --> 15:46.760
Will you sell it or not?

15:47.399 --> 15:48.520
Yes.

15:49.799 --> 15:50.920
I'll sell it.

16:03.960 --> 16:05.359
One hundred taels of silver.

16:11.039 --> 16:12.359
Hold it carefully.

16:17.440 --> 16:20.359
I just heard your father
call you Lanxiang.

16:21.440 --> 16:23.879
I imagine this flower
means something to you.

16:25.480 --> 16:27.280
Won't you miss it?

16:28.679 --> 16:31.280
I like this more.

16:41.200 --> 16:42.560
Take care, Young Lady.

16:43.759 --> 16:44.959
Take care.

16:46.200 --> 16:47.479
Take care!

16:59.840 --> 17:00.920
Lanxiang,

17:01.440 --> 17:02.599
if Yuchan finds out

17:02.600 --> 17:05.720
you sold the orchid they gave you,

17:05.799 --> 17:07.599
won't she be upset?

17:07.799 --> 17:08.879
Father,

17:08.880 --> 17:11.119
if you had given me this orchid

17:11.279 --> 17:13.159
and someone offered
a hundred taels for it,

17:13.160 --> 17:14.479
should I sell it?

17:14.480 --> 17:15.720
Of course.

17:16.000 --> 17:17.879
A hundred taels!

17:18.039 --> 17:20.760
Think how hard you'd have
to work to earn that much.

17:21.559 --> 17:25.000
An orchid can't feed or clothe you,

17:25.480 --> 17:27.078
and it isn't worth much anyway.

17:27.079 --> 17:28.760
I'll dig up another one for you later.

17:29.160 --> 17:30.078
That's right.

17:30.079 --> 17:31.798
If Yuchan and the others find out

17:31.799 --> 17:34.399
that one orchid sold
for a hundred taels of silver,

17:34.400 --> 17:35.919
they'll only be happy.

17:36.359 --> 17:37.159
Later,

17:37.160 --> 17:38.479
I'll give them fifty taels.

17:38.480 --> 17:40.079
They'll be even happier.

17:41.200 --> 17:42.078
Right.

17:42.079 --> 17:43.760
Give them fifty taels.

17:58.759 --> 17:59.879
Young Lady,

18:00.039 --> 18:02.439
the more I look at this orchid,
the more familiar it seems.

18:02.440 --> 18:05.040
Why does it look a bit
like Young Master Lin's orchid?

18:07.960 --> 18:08.919
Does it?

18:11.920 --> 18:13.960
Even the pots look like a pair.

18:14.119 --> 18:15.959
Young Master Lin is so strange.

18:15.960 --> 18:17.118
He says it's precious to him,

18:17.120 --> 18:18.984
yet he doesn't take
proper care of it at all.

18:19.359 --> 18:21.919
How could
he display it in a pot like this?

18:23.759 --> 18:25.800
What do you think he should use?

18:27.440 --> 18:29.399
The kinds you normally use.

18:30.000 --> 18:32.599
A bronze gu vessel,
a mallet-shaped vase,

18:32.680 --> 18:34.960
a Ding ware flower vase,
and a yarrow-stalk vase.

18:37.240 --> 18:39.159
Even you can see
they don't belong together.

19:01.680 --> 19:04.839
"I return your precious pearl
with tears in my eyes,

19:05.319 --> 19:08.679
regretting we did not meet
before I wed."

19:15.319 --> 19:18.879
Then I'll spare you that regret.

19:27.784 --> 19:29.240
Since they don't belong together,

19:29.920 --> 19:31.720
I'll just destroy it.

19:32.440 --> 19:33.078
But

19:33.079 --> 19:34.679
you only just bought it...

19:34.680 --> 19:36.598
I am the daughter of a duke,

19:36.599 --> 19:39.320
raised under my family's teachings
and brought up in the palace.

19:39.680 --> 19:41.599
Surely I can destroy one orchid.

19:42.400 --> 19:44.200
Of course you can.

19:47.359 --> 19:49.159
Go get the head butler.

19:49.720 --> 19:51.560
I have something for him to do.

19:53.240 --> 19:54.280
Yes.

20:06.740 --> 20:11.118
(Imperial Theater)

20:11.119 --> 20:13.518
(Since the capital moved north,)

20:13.519 --> 20:16.639
(the Imperial Theater has drawn
theater troupes from far and wide.)

20:16.640 --> 20:18.639
(Whenever there is a performance,)

20:18.640 --> 20:23.679
(peddlers, laborers, officials,
and nobles all gather here.)

20:23.680 --> 20:26.079
(Storytelling, music, and singing)

20:26.160 --> 20:28.240
(fill the place with lively chatter.)

20:52.180 --> 20:55.340
(Furong, Head of the Furong Troupe)

21:00.599 --> 21:01.479
Furong.

21:01.480 --> 21:03.118
Mister Lu asked me to bring you

21:03.119 --> 21:05.040
the final act
of The Tale of the Treasure Chest.

21:08.160 --> 21:09.719
Well, this is a surprise.

21:09.720 --> 21:11.598
Scholar Zongbai actually finished it.

21:11.599 --> 21:14.038
Usually, he gets completely drunk

21:14.039 --> 21:15.599
and keeps putting off the manuscript.

21:16.160 --> 21:17.719
When he was slightly tipsy,

21:17.720 --> 21:20.240
I watered down his liquor
with sweetened water.

21:21.640 --> 21:23.439
I knew I could
count on you, clever girl.

21:23.440 --> 21:25.500
Once you've learned enough
to write your own plays,

21:25.512 --> 21:27.030
I'll find the finest performers

21:27.039 --> 21:28.118
to stage your work

21:28.119 --> 21:30.598
for all of Jinling to see.

21:30.599 --> 21:31.479
Me?

21:31.480 --> 21:32.639
Write plays?

21:33.200 --> 21:34.320
Of course.

21:34.350 --> 21:35.768
Every time I go to Scholar Zongbai

21:35.784 --> 21:36.950
to ask for a new script,

21:36.960 --> 21:38.358
he keeps telling me

21:38.359 --> 21:39.999
that once you've learned the craft,

21:40.000 --> 21:41.838
I should stop bothering him.

21:41.839 --> 21:43.119
Learned the craft?

21:43.440 --> 21:45.240
I'm not even his apprentice.

21:46.160 --> 21:48.518
If Lu Zongbai cared
about titles and formalities,

21:48.519 --> 21:50.599
he wouldn't be Lu Zongbai.

21:50.640 --> 21:51.838
Think about it.

21:51.839 --> 21:54.079
If all he needed was for you
to transcribe his work,

21:54.119 --> 21:55.960
why would he teach you so much?

22:00.240 --> 22:02.879
Mister Lu always makes
his lessons so interesting.

22:03.160 --> 22:04.839
I get completely absorbed in listening.

22:08.808 --> 22:10.310
Performers are looked down upon...

22:10.319 --> 22:11.700
(The Tale of the Treasure Chest)

22:12.319 --> 22:14.439
And those who write plays for them

22:14.440 --> 22:16.200
are hardly considered
respectable either.

22:16.640 --> 22:19.240
But let me ask you one thing.

22:19.359 --> 22:20.720
Do you enjoy it?

22:24.319 --> 22:25.439
I do.

22:27.000 --> 22:28.200
Then that's all that matters.

22:28.359 --> 22:29.358
Life is short.

22:29.359 --> 22:31.599
You should do what you love most

22:31.640 --> 22:33.480
to make this life worth living.

22:40.759 --> 22:42.240
There's a new act.

22:44.799 --> 22:46.078
Wonderful!

22:46.079 --> 22:48.359
The Tale of the Treasure Chest
finally has a new act.

22:57.780 --> 23:03.660
♪The wind scatters the clouds,
and rain turns to mud♪

23:03.860 --> 23:09.020
♪A memory rises in my heart♪

23:09.420 --> 23:14.740
♪Faded ink takes on fragrance
as spring turns to summer♪

23:15.519 --> 23:17.040
(Let me ask you one thing.)

23:17.119 --> 23:18.320
(Do you enjoy it?)

23:21.240 --> 23:22.240
(I do.)

23:22.340 --> 23:24.859
♪I watch the long road wind and turn♪

23:24.860 --> 23:27.539
♪Even the clamor falls silent♪

23:27.540 --> 23:33.180
♪The keepsake rests against
my heart as I quietly wait♪

23:33.260 --> 23:35.819
♪I watch the passing years wear away♪

23:35.820 --> 23:39.219
♪Even deep affection slowly fades♪

23:39.220 --> 23:46.980
♪The past falls like
withered leaves into the dust♪

23:54.000 --> 23:54.758
Come.

23:54.759 --> 23:56.520
Let's rehearse.

23:59.839 --> 24:03.038
♪My Lord, uphold justice♪

24:03.039 --> 24:07.639
♪Tell right from wrong
and judge what is just♪

24:07.680 --> 24:10.159
♪We need only
open the chest here in court♪

24:10.160 --> 24:12.719
♪To prove this woman's innocence♪

24:12.720 --> 24:15.239
♪If everything she says is true♪

24:15.240 --> 24:18.798
♪I beg you to find him guilty♪

24:18.799 --> 24:21.118
♪My Lord, find her guilty at once♪

24:21.119 --> 24:24.040
♪Open the chest at once♪

24:33.359 --> 24:35.359
I still feel like
something's missing here.

24:35.480 --> 24:37.240
There's a fire burning inside me

24:37.279 --> 24:38.720
that I haven't let out yet.

24:39.799 --> 24:41.960
Then let's see what else we can add.

24:42.799 --> 24:44.760
What's missing?

24:54.000 --> 24:55.119
Thank you.

24:56.640 --> 24:58.040
I'll take it over for you.

24:58.359 --> 24:58.879
Then

24:58.880 --> 25:00.280
thank you for your help.

25:00.480 --> 25:01.720
It's no trouble.

25:14.720 --> 25:15.520
This way.

25:26.880 --> 25:27.720
Thank you.

25:32.319 --> 25:33.520
Where should I put it?

25:34.279 --> 25:35.598
Just put it in that chest.

25:35.599 --> 25:36.480
All right.

26:04.160 --> 26:07.959
- Good.
- Good.

26:07.960 --> 26:11.239
♪What grievance does this woman have?♪

26:11.240 --> 26:13.439
♪Tell me everything♪

26:13.440 --> 26:17.679
♪My Lord, allow me to explain♪

26:17.680 --> 26:18.798
♪My Lord♪

26:18.799 --> 26:20.038
♪Let me tell you instead♪

26:20.039 --> 26:21.199
♪Her name is Tanniang♪

26:21.200 --> 26:22.024
♪She's a widow♪

26:22.072 --> 26:24.350
♪She should have remained
faithful to her late husband♪

26:24.359 --> 26:26.239
♪Yet she tried to seduce me♪

26:26.240 --> 26:27.518
♪But I refused her advances♪

26:27.519 --> 26:28.580
What do you think, Jinlan?

26:28.590 --> 26:29.838
I told you so.

26:29.839 --> 26:32.838
Wasn't this play
worth coming all this way to see?

26:32.839 --> 26:34.520
♪Curse Guo Qiu♪

26:35.119 --> 26:37.040
As expected of a work
by the Third Place Scholar.

26:37.839 --> 26:40.119
Furong is the one
who performs it so well.

26:52.440 --> 26:57.919
- Good!
- Good!

27:24.039 --> 27:24.999
Scholar Han!

27:25.000 --> 27:26.078
Wake up.

27:26.079 --> 27:27.719
Wake up, Scholar Han.

27:27.720 --> 27:29.118
Someone is trying to harm us

27:29.119 --> 27:30.800
and ruin both our reputations.

27:31.119 --> 27:32.079
Wake up.

27:32.559 --> 27:37.358
♪Tell right from wrong
and judge what is just♪

27:37.359 --> 27:40.038
♪We need only open
the chest here in court♪

27:40.039 --> 27:42.560
♪To prove this woman's innocence♪

27:44.079 --> 27:45.558
I bribed one of the troupe's musicians

27:45.559 --> 27:46.719
and got a copy of the lyrics.

27:46.720 --> 27:48.879
Do you think this chest

27:48.880 --> 27:50.919
holds pearls and a robe woven with gold?

27:51.440 --> 27:53.038
Don't ruin something beautiful.

27:53.039 --> 27:56.199
♪Say no more. One look will tell♪

27:56.200 --> 27:56.679
♪Guards!♪

27:56.680 --> 27:57.399
♪- Yes!
- Yes!♪

27:57.400 --> 27:59.558
♪Open the chest at once♪

27:59.559 --> 28:00.820
Good!

28:32.839 --> 28:39.079
- Good!
- Good!

28:44.960 --> 28:56.399
♪There's a ghost in the chest♪

28:57.720 --> 28:59.439
♪There's a ghost in the chest♪

28:59.440 --> 29:01.280
♪There's a ghost in the chest♪

29:01.400 --> 29:05.639
♪There's a ghost in the chest♪

29:08.400 --> 29:09.439
No.

29:09.960 --> 29:11.038
Jinlan.

29:11.039 --> 29:12.520
There's no one in the chest.

29:14.200 --> 29:15.760
No one.

29:15.960 --> 29:16.879
There's a ghost.

29:16.880 --> 29:21.159
♪Take this guilty woman
and throw her in jail♪

29:22.319 --> 29:24.919
- Good!
- Good!

29:25.799 --> 29:26.919
Jinlan.

29:26.920 --> 29:28.960
That female ghost just now

29:29.200 --> 29:30.800
looked a little familiar.

29:34.559 --> 29:37.038
Someone who could drug
Scholar Han at Qixia Academy

29:37.039 --> 29:38.358
and go to such great lengths

29:38.359 --> 29:40.439
to transport him
from outside the city into the city

29:40.799 --> 29:41.479
is probably

29:41.480 --> 29:44.240
one of Scholar Han's powerful
and influential classmates.

29:45.039 --> 29:46.078
Furong.

29:46.079 --> 29:47.480
Scholar Han is fine.

29:47.519 --> 29:50.040
He must have drunk
tea laced with a sedative.

29:50.920 --> 29:52.518
Once the drug wears off,

29:52.519 --> 29:53.800
he'll wake up.

29:54.119 --> 29:56.560
If everything's fine,
I'll get back to work.

30:05.720 --> 30:08.239
When disaster strikes,
innocent bystanders often suffer.

30:08.240 --> 30:09.879
Fortunately,
you were quick-witted today.

30:09.880 --> 30:11.439
Not only did you escape trouble,

30:11.440 --> 30:13.800
but you also made the play
even more dramatic.

30:16.480 --> 30:18.879
Could they have been after me?

30:19.200 --> 30:21.599
Scholar Han got dragged
into this because of me.

30:23.400 --> 30:24.760
After you?

30:25.440 --> 30:26.879
You're just a young lady.

30:26.880 --> 30:28.440
Who could you possibly have offended?

30:30.000 --> 30:31.639
I've never offended anyone.

30:36.720 --> 30:39.480
The tree that stands out
bears the brunt of the wind.

30:40.079 --> 30:41.719
Scholar Han must have

30:41.720 --> 30:43.679
earned a teacher's favor at the academy

30:43.690 --> 30:45.000
and stood in someone else's way.

30:45.010 --> 30:46.872
That's why they devised
such a vicious scheme

30:46.888 --> 30:48.550
to disgrace Scholar Han

30:48.550 --> 30:49.912
in front of everyone

30:49.944 --> 30:51.820
and ruin his prospects
for an official career.

30:53.119 --> 30:53.999
Furong.

30:54.000 --> 30:55.570
Third Young Master Lin wants to see you.

30:55.580 --> 30:57.630
He often comes to see our plays

30:57.640 --> 30:58.790
and tips us generously.

30:58.799 --> 31:00.320
It would be difficult to turn him away.

31:02.440 --> 31:03.800
I'll be right back.

31:03.920 --> 31:04.960
Later,

31:05.079 --> 31:07.078
we'll go back with Scholar Han

31:07.079 --> 31:08.800
and discuss what to do.

31:28.519 --> 31:29.838
Thank you for your help.

31:29.839 --> 31:30.839
Thank you.

31:37.720 --> 31:38.518
Young Lady Xu.

31:38.519 --> 31:39.919
Furong is looking for you.

31:40.000 --> 31:40.960
Coming.

32:29.680 --> 32:31.159
Father, you were one move ahead.

32:31.160 --> 32:32.679
I'm impressed.

32:33.079 --> 32:34.119
Bring him in.

32:41.640 --> 32:43.679
Life isn't a game of chess.

32:44.559 --> 32:45.599
If you lose,

32:46.079 --> 32:47.960
you can always play another round.

32:48.599 --> 32:50.320
But in a family of our standing,

32:50.640 --> 32:51.839
more often than not,

32:52.240 --> 32:55.000
losing means death.

32:59.119 --> 33:00.679
Useless fool.

33:01.640 --> 33:03.599
You couldn't even handle
such a simple task.

33:05.272 --> 33:06.390
Feed him to the wild dogs.

33:14.279 --> 33:17.240
Even lions and elephants use
their full strength against a rabbit.

33:18.720 --> 33:22.159
The greatest mistake
is letting mercy get in the way.

33:32.640 --> 33:33.760
Father,

33:34.359 --> 33:36.679
I won't show Xu Lanxiang any mercy.

33:37.640 --> 33:39.719
I just don't want her to die too easily

33:39.720 --> 33:41.278
and become Lin Jinqi's obsession,

33:41.279 --> 33:42.960
someone he can never forget.

33:44.559 --> 33:46.119
That does make some sense.

33:49.680 --> 33:51.240
Then we'll do as you wish.

33:51.920 --> 33:53.520
Ruin Xu Lanxiang

33:54.720 --> 33:57.240
and put an end
to Lin Jinqi's feelings for her.

34:41.679 --> 34:42.919
Guihua,

34:43.400 --> 34:45.080
have some water.

35:03.239 --> 35:04.999
Any news of Lanxiang?

35:14.679 --> 35:15.598
Guihua,

35:15.599 --> 35:16.720
you...

35:17.039 --> 35:18.959
Don't worry.

35:20.000 --> 35:23.118
Lanxiang is brave and careful,

35:23.120 --> 35:24.136
and she's clever, too.

35:24.168 --> 35:25.470
Even if something has happened,

35:25.480 --> 35:28.280
she'll find a way out of danger.

35:29.159 --> 35:30.959
Don't worry.

35:32.800 --> 35:34.519
It's all because I was careless.

35:34.559 --> 35:37.240
I thought those men
were after Scholar Han.

35:38.000 --> 35:39.200
I never expected

35:40.039 --> 35:41.399
Lanxiang was their target.

35:48.039 --> 35:49.439
This isn't your fault.

35:49.440 --> 35:50.600
It's mine.

35:52.920 --> 35:54.118
I shouldn't have

35:54.119 --> 35:57.320
let Lanxiang
deliver the manuscript alone.

35:57.800 --> 36:00.439
I failed her as a father.

36:01.400 --> 36:03.198
All I thought about was making money.

36:03.199 --> 36:04.959
I was so busy with the shop

36:05.000 --> 36:07.479
that I neglected my own daughter.

36:15.440 --> 36:16.999
Don't blame yourself right now.

36:18.360 --> 36:19.959
The most important thing

36:20.239 --> 36:22.039
is to find out where Lanxiang is.

36:29.679 --> 36:31.160
The night curfew has already begun.

36:31.440 --> 36:33.240
Who could be visiting at this hour?

36:51.480 --> 36:52.600
Young Master?

36:52.920 --> 36:53.999
Uncle Xu.

36:54.239 --> 36:55.399
Come inside.

36:55.440 --> 36:56.320
Quickly.

36:58.599 --> 36:59.640
Uncle Xu.

37:00.079 --> 37:01.839
I heard Lanxiang is missing.

37:02.119 --> 37:02.919
Young Master.

37:02.920 --> 37:03.800
Uncle Xu.

37:04.199 --> 37:04.919
Uncle Xu.

37:04.920 --> 37:06.078
Please save Lanxiang.

37:06.079 --> 37:07.919
I'm begging you. Please save Lanxiang.

37:07.920 --> 37:08.919
Uncle Xu.

37:09.000 --> 37:10.078
Don't worry, Uncle Xu.

37:10.079 --> 37:11.640
We'll find her.

37:11.800 --> 37:13.959
I came here precisely
to look for Lanxiang.

37:14.039 --> 37:14.720
Get up.

37:14.880 --> 37:16.238
We'll find a way together.

37:16.239 --> 37:17.919
Please save Lanxiang.

37:17.920 --> 37:18.680
Come.

37:22.280 --> 37:24.080
Help us think of a way.

37:25.480 --> 37:26.919
Don't worry, Uncle Xu.

37:32.199 --> 37:33.320
Any leads?

37:37.360 --> 37:38.800
I found this on the table

37:39.199 --> 37:40.839
after I woke up.

37:45.656 --> 37:47.336
Didn't you report this
to the authorities?

37:47.400 --> 37:49.430
Why didn't you give
the drawing to the authorities?

37:50.119 --> 37:51.879
In a city as large as Jinling,

37:52.000 --> 37:55.439
a person vanished without a trace.

37:56.159 --> 37:58.919
They pulled it off so cleanly

37:59.119 --> 38:03.399
that we're afraid any clues we hand over
might go to the wrong people,

38:04.840 --> 38:06.200
not those we can trust.

38:12.519 --> 38:13.879
We suspect

38:13.944 --> 38:15.680
the culprit
is either wealthy or powerful.

38:15.920 --> 38:18.399
He may have people
inside the authorities.

38:19.519 --> 38:21.080
The man Lanxiang drew,

38:21.280 --> 38:22.399
judging by his clothes,

38:22.400 --> 38:24.280
was a laborer with our troupe.

38:24.320 --> 38:26.879
But I've asked everyone in the troupe,

38:28.639 --> 38:30.240
and no one says they saw him.

38:33.039 --> 38:35.320
Since Lanxiang disappeared
from the troupe,

38:36.199 --> 38:37.879
we should start looking here.

38:46.712 --> 38:47.864
When Lanxiang came yesterday,

38:47.880 --> 38:49.350
we were preparing to stage a new play

38:49.400 --> 38:50.540
and were all busy rehearsing.

38:50.550 --> 38:52.420
We didn't notice
what was happening around us.

38:52.920 --> 38:54.160
When I woke up,

38:54.599 --> 38:55.800
the door was wide open,

38:56.239 --> 38:57.879
and the ink on the table was still wet.

38:58.039 --> 39:00.359
The culprit couldn't have
left long before.

39:13.360 --> 39:15.120
The performance had just ended,

39:15.176 --> 39:17.800
and donkey carts and mule carts
were leaving one after another.

39:18.248 --> 39:20.270
The culprit must
have slipped away among them

39:20.280 --> 39:21.680
and taken Lanxiang with him.

39:26.840 --> 39:28.770
Furong. A squad
of soldiers has arrived outside.

39:28.780 --> 39:30.690
They say a nobleman
has lost something valuable

39:30.700 --> 39:32.168
and they'll search the entire troupe.

39:33.079 --> 39:34.240
I'll go take a look.

39:39.800 --> 39:41.080
Seal off the Imperial Theater.

39:41.239 --> 39:42.640
No one is allowed to leave.

39:48.580 --> 39:53.518
(Imperial Theater)

39:53.519 --> 39:54.680
Check up ahead.

40:22.079 --> 40:22.999
Check over there.

40:23.000 --> 40:24.879
Hurry! Move!

40:27.840 --> 40:29.518
- Stand still!
- Stand still!

40:29.519 --> 40:30.640
Stand still!

40:33.880 --> 40:37.039
Would the deposed Crown Prince
really be in a lowly place like this?

40:37.119 --> 40:38.760
Is the information reliable?

40:39.760 --> 40:43.080
We'll know once we search the place.

40:43.800 --> 40:45.999
Is the back entrance covered?

40:46.000 --> 40:47.518
I've already stationed men there.

40:47.519 --> 40:49.879
If anyone tries
to escape through the back,

40:49.880 --> 40:51.559
we'll catch them red-handed.

41:10.000 --> 41:11.120
Sir,

41:11.440 --> 41:13.399
I'm sorry.

41:13.400 --> 41:14.919
I was just going to get some firewood

41:14.920 --> 41:16.640
and accidentally bumped into you.

41:18.679 --> 41:19.800
Scholar Han.

41:20.800 --> 41:21.760
Uncle Liu.

41:23.039 --> 41:24.359
This is Uncle Liu.

41:25.000 --> 41:27.760
He's worked in the troupe's
tearoom for many years.

41:29.400 --> 41:29.879
Furong

41:29.880 --> 41:32.359
questioned all the laborers
in the troupe.

41:32.639 --> 41:34.319
None of them saw anything unusual.

41:34.320 --> 41:35.359
That's right.

41:35.800 --> 41:37.280
Did she ask Uncle Liu?

41:37.440 --> 41:38.399
Yes.

41:40.239 --> 41:41.359
Yesterday,

41:42.559 --> 41:44.718
did you see an unfamiliar laborer

41:44.719 --> 41:45.959
coming in and out of the troupe?

41:48.760 --> 41:50.559
Think carefully before you answer.

41:51.000 --> 41:52.519
If I'm not satisfied with your answer,

41:53.400 --> 41:55.559
I'll have to let
the soldiers question you.

41:59.000 --> 42:01.519
I only want to find the young lady
who disappeared yesterday.

42:02.280 --> 42:03.720
As for the authorities,

42:04.039 --> 42:05.240
I'm not interested.

42:12.840 --> 42:13.959
Uncle Liu.

42:15.000 --> 42:16.039
Lanxiang

42:16.079 --> 42:17.720
is Mister Lu's disciple.

42:18.000 --> 42:19.439
Mister Lu was up all night

42:19.440 --> 42:21.160
because of this.

42:21.639 --> 42:23.118
If you know anything,

42:23.119 --> 42:24.919
just tell us quietly.

42:25.639 --> 42:27.200
Those two soldiers just now

42:27.320 --> 42:29.280
came from the direction
of the back entrance.

42:29.480 --> 42:32.160
Judging by their uniforms, they're
from the Rear Military Command.

42:32.639 --> 42:33.760
Outside the back entrance,

42:33.880 --> 42:36.320
there must be heavy guards by now.

42:40.960 --> 42:43.280
Tell me what you saw yesterday,

42:43.639 --> 42:45.720
and I promise to get you
safely out of here.

42:47.360 --> 42:48.640
Search every corner.

42:48.840 --> 42:50.240
Then check the back entrance again.

42:53.760 --> 42:55.240
As long as you get me out of here,

42:55.559 --> 42:56.879
I'll tell you

42:57.360 --> 42:58.559
what that man looked like.

42:59.840 --> 43:00.999
You have my word.

43:05.060 --> 43:07.740
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:09.320 --> 43:11.158
Isn't this Young Lady Shuang?

43:11.159 --> 43:13.519
What brings you here?

43:14.599 --> 43:16.999
I came to see what Mother's

43:17.119 --> 43:18.959
new favorite looks like.

43:19.519 --> 43:21.120
Both of you, leave us.

43:21.440 --> 43:23.399
I have a few private words

43:23.400 --> 43:25.280
to say to this young lady.

43:25.559 --> 43:26.760
Well...

43:27.239 --> 43:28.559
I'm afraid we can't do that.

43:31.960 --> 43:33.120
What?

43:33.400 --> 43:34.999
Now that there's someone new,

43:35.239 --> 43:36.959
my word means nothing?

44:00.300 --> 44:04.420
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

44:07.260 --> 44:11.780
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

44:13.060 --> 44:16.980
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:17.660 --> 44:20.420
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:21.140 --> 44:23.460
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:23.460 --> 44:26.540
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:28.060 --> 44:32.300
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:35.220 --> 44:39.380
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:41.180 --> 44:44.740
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:44.740 --> 44:48.300
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:49.100 --> 44:54.780
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

44:55.140 --> 44:59.460
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

44:59.820 --> 45:02.780
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:02.780 --> 45:06.540
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:06.540 --> 45:09.420
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:09.420 --> 45:13.500
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:13.500 --> 45:16.860
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:16.860 --> 45:20.620
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:20.620 --> 45:24.620
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

45:25.380 --> 45:29.540
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

45:29.540 --> 45:32.980
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:32.980 --> 45:36.620
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:36.620 --> 45:39.500
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:39.500 --> 45:43.580
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:43.580 --> 45:46.940
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:46.940 --> 45:50.580
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:50.580 --> 45:58.380
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
